# Enterprise Business Notes — Platform Constitution

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Canonical business notes  
Sprint foundation: **CO-UX-021**

## Constitutional principles

1. Business Notes are **official enterprise context** — not a personal notepad.
2. Every saved note **dual-writes** into the **Enterprise Activity Registry** (`eventKind: notes`, `sourceSystem: business_notes`).
3. Soft delete only — never permanent hard delete.
4. One pinned note per entity scope (`entityKind` + `entityId`).
5. AI-ready projection exists (`projectBusinessNotesForAiContext`) — **do not** implement Chanakya/SARATHI note reading in this sprint.
6. Compact Notes icon in workspace headers — do **not** redesign Opportunity Workspace or Lender Lifecycle chrome.

